WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:39.920
Elle and I saw that Cecilia, a childhood
friend of Torres, was working for Gottn.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.420
Beecha, Mondo, and I were fighting
on our own thanks to Mr. Wong.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:50.020
But we didn't want to destroy the port,
so we couldn't take out all of Gottn's guys.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:54.120
And on top of that, Torres brought
Cecilia aboard the Argama.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.650
This is a problem.

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:02.030
CRYBABY CECILIA

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:02.030
(Part 2)

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.900
Well...

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:07.210
I thought it would be nice
for her to stay a bit longer.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.750
Why are you dancing, Judau?

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.500
I'm not!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:14.670
Cecilia! Wait! Where do
you think you're going?!

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:15.590
Let go of me!

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.780
You can't just go wherever
you want aboard the Argama.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.750
She was talking with Gottn
behind the pizza parlor.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.260
- Elle!
- Cecilia!

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.800
I... I didn't tell them anything!

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.980
Don't dodge the bullet by crying!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.620
They sent me to get the map,
but I couldn't!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:35.800
I didn't do anything, so let
me go home. Please, Torres!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.780
Judau, where's the captain?

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.700
No clue.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.640
Find him. Ask him what we
should do with Cecilia.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.970
S-Sure...

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.370
Torres... am I going to be arrested?

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.660
I guess so...
There's nothing else we can do.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.390
Torres...

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:58.440
Look, I can't promise
it'll be right away, but...

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:03.290
If what you say is true, I'll try
to get them to let you go.

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:15.120
Because of your screwups, our only
 working mobile suit is a single Ga-Zowmn!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.590
No, Master Gottn--

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.840
I don't want to hear excuses!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:22.060
No, I mean, we have three more
mobile suits on their way to Granada.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:23.400
If we went all out
against the Argama...!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:29.020
How? We don't know which port it's in,
and we can't lure it out with only four units!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.520
Master Gottn.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.410
The cargo ship next to us is asking that
we reimburse them for their losses.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.610
Shut up! Pay them whatever they want!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.270
How do I come
up with these ideas?!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.170
Hey, you! Buy up every
cargo ship in this port!

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.090
But... most of them are so
damaged they can hardly move!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.790
That'll be good enough!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.360
What are you planning to do?

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.710
You just follow my orders.
This plan is so great.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.180
Just you watch, Lady Haman!

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:04.080
Even without the help of Mistress Chara,
Gottn will fulfill his duties splendidly!

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.070
Did I catch a cold?

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:12.740
I know I'm a prisoner, but I have
so much laundry left to do...

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.410
So let me get back to work.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.630
I've come to talk to you about that.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.430
You're going to let me go?

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.440
This ship will leave port
about half a day from now.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.570
Before that, you'll be sent to
Granada's POW facility.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.070
Here, your orders.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.220
I don't wanna!

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.390
I like it here in this ship!

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.120
I've been working my hardest
as a prisoner, right?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.870
And if you like, Captain,
I'll do anything else you want.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.260
S-Stop that!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.720
You shouldn't be so coy!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.870
Stop it!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.300
Are you feeling jealous?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.440
Don't compare me to an old hag like you!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.460
Old hag?!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.380
Both of you...

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.270
Captain!

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.390
Uh... is this a bad time?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.390
No, absolutely not!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.450
Someone on board has been in touch
with Gottn from the Endra--

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.420
Gottn is here?!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.310
This has nothing to do with you!

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.900
He's my subordinate!

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.290
Stop it!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.890
Who's the spy?!

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:06.150
Her name's Cecilia. She's one
of Torres's childhood friends.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.780
But we're not sure about her yet.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.030
There's definitely some
reason why--

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.520
Do people ever spy without a reason?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.470
Damn Gottn!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:15.620
What if he attacks Granada
in a foolish way,

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.510
and then Lady Haman
can't use it as a base?

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.380
So Haman plans to make Granada
her headquarters?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.510
Wait, who said that?

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.330
You just did.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.380
Dammit!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.500
Yes, the captain is right here.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.440
What, mobile suits?!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.420
Yes.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.560
Mobile suits from the Endra corps.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.250
But several cargo ships are
also approaching for some reason.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.340
They haven't entered the port yet, right?!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.200
Correct.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.620
Captain!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.780
Chara!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.380
Freeze, all of you!

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.930
Don't move, or this girl's
going to lose her eyes!

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.690
I'll really do it!

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.260
That's low, Chara!

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.970
Help me, Torres!

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.190
Do you think you can escape unarmed?!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.010
Shut up!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.870
I'm not going to be your
laundry lady forever!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.670
All hands, emergency!

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:10.380
Chara has escaped with a hostage!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.480
Be ready to launch immediately!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.940
What the--

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.100
No! Let me go!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.710
You know I can't!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.540
Somebody, grab Chara!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.400
Please, let go!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.900
Just shut up and get in!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.550
It's a mobile suit!

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.780
I haven't felt
this way in a while!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.800
Now!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.050
Don't you touch MY mobile suit!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.900
I found a submachine gun!

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:47.140
Play nice and open the hatch,
or this girl's as good as dead!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:49.100
Stop it! Help me!

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.430
Don't open the hatch!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.710
You'll let Chara get away!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.240
Mr. Torres!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.240
They're going to die!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.400
You won't get away!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.170
- Hop on!
- Torres!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.350
Double Zeta, moving out!

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:14.630
Roger!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.550
Stop this thing! Let me off!

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:20.120
Stop crying like a baby!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.790
The people from the Argama
will stop this mobile suit.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.660
When that happens...

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:26.140
You're supposed to be a spy!
Why are you such a coward?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.980
I didn't do anything--

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:34.980
I need you to take me to Gottn.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.660
I don't know how!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:41.320
Look, if you stay here,
you're going to face a firing squad!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:44.530
What did you expect? You're a spy!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.390
Guess I'll go up from here.

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.300
You're going nowhere!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.940
Dammit! Let go!

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.740
Torres!

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:06.200
It stopped.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.540
The port's lost power?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.230
Is Gottn attacking?

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.390
Isn't that... the Argama?

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.460
You can't lure it out so easily.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:22.110
If we keep blocking the ports with
these ships, it'll show up eventually.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.520
Is Gottn seriously trying
to shut down Granada?

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.500
My family is still in Granada...!

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.120
Quiet! I don't need the details!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.710
They're crashing cargo ships
at each port entrance!

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:42.340
They're trying to smoke us out!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.830
If they damage the port entrances,
air could start leaking!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.060
Where are you going, Judau?

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.660
I'm getting my beam rifle!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.330
I've gotta stop Gottn!

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:04.520
A secret passage?

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.620
I don't care what it is!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.760
Who the hell made this
stupid thing so narrow?

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.320
Hey, the Mk. II is stuck!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:23.540
There's no way you could fit a mobile
suit through the city's access hatch!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.120
Come with me!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:25.680
NO!

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:26.710
Then it's the guillotine!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.870
I thought it was the firing squad!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.240
Cecilia!

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:34.880
Cecilia!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.640
Cecilia...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.690
I don't want to be arrested...!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:46.130
No one's going to arrest you!
I'll make them understand, Cecilia!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.000
Granada is...

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.360
It's just a power outage!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.020
If I don't run, I'll die!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:51.580
Don't run!

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.380
Cecilia!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:54.760
Mr. Torres!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.110
Get Chara for me!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.920
Torres!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.450
I have to stop Gottn!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.760
Wait!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.590
Where the hell is the Argama?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.960
Hey, something in
Port 22 is starting to move!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.410
Roger that!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:21.660
How far do I have to go
to get outside! Dammit!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.080
Th-This is...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.970
This is... Anaheim.

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:38.590
I'm sure of it.
It's Anaheim Electronics.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.680
We are temporarily stopping
the production line.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:44.820
Due to brownouts in the area, we are
temporarily stopping the production line.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.310
All workers, please enter
the evacuation area at this time.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:50.620
All workers, please enter
the evacuation area at this time.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.620
I'm glad you could make it.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.960
Take the transport ship to Port 33!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.020
Yes, sir!

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.530
These are tickets for the
emigration ship Cassiopeia.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.510
- It's the exact number I promised.
- Set course for Port 33!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:07.030
Wait. Take this with you!

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.080
Inside is a special
reward: gold ingots.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.400
I'd be careful opening it
around other people.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.190
But...

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.980
You've been through a lot.
Thank you for everything.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.680
Thank you.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:39.440
We dropped a ship on Port 33. The
Argama won't be able to get out now!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.060
Torres!

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.880
Mom, go on ahead!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.620
But there's no time...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.360
Y-You told Gottn?!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.600
Torres...

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:21.190
I still think of you
as a friend, Torres.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:25.030
B-But you're about to board
that emigration ship!

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:28.500
Please don't worry. I played this well.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.370
I even have an extra
ticket, Torres! Here!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.540
If you come with me, I won't be scared.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:38.560
And you won't have
to keep fighting, Torres.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.900
Torres?

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:46.610
You want me to leave everyone
on the Argama to die?!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:51.800
I lied and said the Argama was at
Port 33! So it'll be all right, Torres!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.950
Cecilia, how dare you!

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.090
So you're okay with getting
everyone at that port killed?!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:13:01.000
Never mind that Port 33 is the port
closest to Granada's city areas!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:05.190
You just want me to go along with you
because you're afraid of escaping alone!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.660
No, Torres!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.420
I... I love you.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.740
You're so selfish!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.620
Hurry up and leave for some colony!

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.240
Torres...

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.300
If leave me, Torres, I--

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:26.720
Pray to God, not me.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:30.220
No! God is always mean to me!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:32.260
You're all I have, Torres!

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.860
I hate crybabies who can
only think about themselves!

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.200
Your family should be enough for you!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:42.430
To me, my family is a burden!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.490
You want too much!

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.780
Judau! The enemy crushed Port 33!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.760
So close to the city?!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.530
Is that them?!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.410
Now, next up--

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.420
Why is the Double Zeta here?!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:17.960
Wasn't the Double Zeta
supposed to be at Port 33?!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.350
Dodge it, Cleyu!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.770
Master Gottn! We've used
up all our ships!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.560
What should we do?

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:35.650
An emigration ship is leaving.
from Port 27. It's the Cassiopeia.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.420
Drive that ship over to the Argama's port!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.120
Don't worry about the Double Zeta!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:44.090
Cassiopeia, hurry up! Now's
your chance to escape Granada!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:48.430
If you haven't fastened your
seatbelts, hold on tight!

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:51.340
If you haven't put on your makeshift
suit yet, it's inside the case above you.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:55.200
There's a mobile suit battle going on!
Why are you guys departing right now?

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.630
They can't help it.
They're already over capacity.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:01.570
What was that guy just now, Cecilia!

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.850
That has nothing to do with you, Dad!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:08.350
What?! You're saying a parent has nothing
to do with what his daughter does?!

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.550
This is all because
you'd never discipline her!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.120
Oh, there are mobile suits!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.830
Are they using the emigration
ship as a shield?!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.170
- Turn the nose to starboard!
- Yes, sir!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.700
We're surrounded!

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.950
To think that it opened up right here...

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:52.330
What's wrong? Was there a
bomb under all the money?

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:54.640
A bomb?

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.870
This is no time to be joking.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:00.590
Shut up! I'm not here
because I want to be!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:04.560
Cecilia wouldn't shut up about it,
so I went along, and now look at us!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.830
If this is a bomb...

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:17.020
The Cassiopeia is in our way overhead!
It'll be dangerous to keep rising!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.710
Judau! Get rid of the mobile suits!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.030
Don't make it sound
so easy! It's not!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:23.660
Judau, what are you going to do?

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:33.690
I'm not scared... Torres.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:37.510
At this rate, I won't be able
to see you anymore.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.740
So you're okay with getting
everyone at that port killed?!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:40.950
Torres...

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:43.310
...crybabies who can only
think about themselves!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.040
Master Gottn! We have
approached the Argama!

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:52.920
We'll ram it!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.020
Keep your distance from the Argama!

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:55.760
But--

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.760
"Yes, sir!" Just say, "Yes, sir!"

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.500
- Yes, sir!
- The Double Zeta!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.720
He can't attack us like this!

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.060
Shoot it down!

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.930
Don't underestimate me!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.600
He shot us?!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.970
You'd better hide!

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.530
If you want a fight, you've got one!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:27.700
Torres... I'm not going to
be a crybaby forever, either.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.870
Torres...

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:32.080
I'm not afraid...
I'm not afraid at all.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.090
Go down, dammit!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.170
It's over for you!

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:53.500
Creyu!!

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:59.580
If I could get rid of my parents...

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.260
Now you're okay with getting
everyone in the city killed?!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.780
No... not here, Torres.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.610
A portable vernier?!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.620
Judau! The one on the side of the
Cassiopeia... do something about it!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:16.160
- Torres?!
- I'm on it right now!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.630
Judau! The Cassiopeia is packed
full of passengers!

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.940
Torres?!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.170
I know that!

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.190
Damn the Double Zeta!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.500
Nel! Return to ship!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.680
But Cleyu--

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.600
Do you want to get caught in the blast?!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.720
R-Roger!

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:37.270
Move faster! Move faster, further...

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:39.420
I can throw it away outside.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.500
These guys?!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.740
What the?!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:51.980
What's wrong?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.070
Something's stuck to my machine...

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.410
No damage, though.

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:04.340
Heh, running away's
gonna get you killed!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:15.660
What?! A civilian normal suit?!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.400
Get off! HEY!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:20.980
Start the countdown!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.740
Yes, sir!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:27.320
It's Mistress Chara!

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:28.570
WHAT?!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:38.590
Mistress Chara! We'll return right after
we destroy the Double Zeta!

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.900
Please wait there for us!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:45.290
Damned Gottn... he came to rescue
me with a cargo ship like that?!

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:51.260
Cecilia? Isn't that Miss Cecilia?

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.220
A mobile suit is following us...?

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.940
N-No, don't approach this mobile suit!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:58.200
What are you holding?!

00:19:58.200 --> 00:19:59.690
Hey, Miss Cecilia!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:04.460
Torres said that he hated people who
could only think about themselves!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:07.310
Judau plans to chase them back to
the port where Gottn's hiding!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.520
Prepare all mobile suits for launch!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:10.730
Yes, sir!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.530
I'm not crying.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.480
I'm sure... I'm not wimpy...

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.700
Stop it, Miss Cecilia!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.560
I know what you're up to now!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:30.130
Nel's got an enemy mobile
suit on his tail!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:33.070
Are they trying to find us?!

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.180
Target the cannon on the Double Zeta!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.320
Yes, sir!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.700
It's Miss Cecilia, right?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.520
Jump off! I'll catch you!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.190
I can't do that... Torres will hate me.

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:48.570
I'm not wimpy at all.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:53.700
Damn that Double Zeta... But he doesn't know
Master Gottn's ship is right in front of him.

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:55.100
You'll be shot down!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.460
Then I'll just cut off that suit's leg!

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.840
Is the cannon aimed?

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.060
Ready!

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.170
FIRE!

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:09.640
Miss Cecilia! I'm coming!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.280
Please, stop!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:16.560
Farewell, Double Zeta!

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:24.530
Miss Cecilia, I can't do
anything with you there!

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:28.980
The Double Zeta can't move!
Fire! Fire! Shoot it down!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.400
This is it for you!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.600
Torres...!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.770
Cecilia!!

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.190
G-Gottn...

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:51.070
I heard that Axis soldiers were on that ship.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.510
Serves them right.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:54.710
This is video from a relay line!

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.580
Along with the enemy mobile suits...

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.200
Is Judau all right?!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:01.500
Yes, the enemy seem to have
blown themselves up!

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:06.030
I guess we were lucky.

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:08.520
The Cassiopeia is safe and sound, too.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:11.190
Cecilia, I hope you've finally
found some good luck.

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:15.170
Forget about your problems, and do
your best in your new colony!

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:33.150
Why? Why did you do that?

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.660
What a selfish decision.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:47.430 --> 00:23:52.570
The AEUG general staff aren't on the ship,
so they give all kinds of crazy orders!

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:56.770
Haman's deployed a huge fleet
in geosynchronous orbit,

00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:58.800
and we're the ones who could be killed!

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:04.050
The higher-ups have no right to
complain if we're doing it in our own way!

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:07.960
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Judau, Launch!"


00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
JUDAU, LAUNCH!

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.870
Next Time

00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:11.250
Miss Haman... you're so beautiful.
